    <string name="pwr_bat_shizuku_title">Shizuku — unlock real PD watts</string>
    <string name="pwr_bat_shizuku_desc">Samsung &amp; some OEMs lock the USB sysfs paths via SELinux. With Shizuku (official open-source app by Rikka) this app reads in the shell-user context — then we see the real watts from the charger (5/9/15/20 V × USB current).</string>
    <string name="pwr_bat_diag_title">Diagnostics (measurement methods)</string>
    <string name="pwr_bat_diag_desc">If the shown watt figure doesn\'t match your charger — here you can see what each individual sensor source reports. On some OEMs (Samsung, Xiaomi) only one of them gives reliable values.</string>
